OL,3,AUse all powers necessary on
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protests, home secretary
OL,5,Atells police
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after masked activists brought
OL,8,FDover to a standstill on Saturday and
OL,9,Fin a protest on Sunday in Portsmouth
OL,10,Fabout 200 people tried to block
OL,11,Fmigrants being driven away for
OL,12,Fprocessing.
OL,14,FIn a summary of the meeting, the Home
OL,15,FOffice said the protests brought
OL,16,F"unacceptable disorder".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
